play 5 D5 on 100
play 5 G4 off
play 5 B4 off
play 5 D5 off
bars 1
play 5 A4 on 100
play 5 C5 on 100
play 5 E5 on 100
play 5 A4 off
play 5 C5 off
play 5 E5 off
bars 1
play 5 E4 on 100
play 5 G4 on 100
play 5 B4 on 100
play 5 E4 off
play 5 G4 off
play 5 B4 off
bars 0.75
throw repeat on perc
bars 0.25
throw repeat off perc
knob 5 p4 0
play 5 E4 on 1
play 5 E4 off
# outro 4: the voice echoing out
bars 2
throw echo on mel 4
bars 2
throw echo off mel 4
wait 2500
wavstop
stats
